# Cloudflare Pages / Workers Assets headers — Cross-Origin Isolation
# for WebGPU + threaded WASM + SharedArrayBuffer (ADR-2605190824).
# `credentialless` lets cross-origin model bundles (HF, jsdelivr) load
# without their own CORP headers, fetched without credentials.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
